Package:      kfocus-tbt
Architecture: any
Depends:      ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, python3-pyqt6
Description:  KFocus Thunderbolt control tool
 Allows enabling and disabling Thunderbolt temporarily or permanently.

Package:      kfocus-recover-mount
Architecture: any
Depends:      ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description:  KFocus system disk mount tool
 Allows mounting internal system disks from a live ISO for recovery.

Package:      kfocus-pl-gpuboost
Architecture: all
Depends:      ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description:  KFocus Panther Lake GPU Boost tool
 Use this tool to increase GPU performance on select Kubuntu Focus Panther
 Lake systems.
